# This plugin is Markdown and JSON only: no build, no dependencies, no
# runtime of its own. Nothing here reads or stores credentials — every
# connector authenticates through the Claude client's own OAuth flow.

# OS and editor cruft (the directory scanner rejects these in the plugin folder)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
__MACOSX/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Local journey state produced when testing the planner in this repo.
# It holds a real company's business data — never commit it.
.claude/gtm-planner.local.md

# Eval run output (regenerated on every run)
evals/results/
